   450	### Task 3: Thrust curve (impulse conservation)
   451	
   452	**Files:**
   453	- Create: `src/sim/thrustCurve.ts`
   454	- Test: `tests/sim/thrustCurve.test.ts`
   455	
   456	**Interfaces:**
   457	- Consumes: `Motor` from `types.ts`.
   458	- Produces:
   459	  - `thrustAt(motor: Motor, t: number): number` — instantaneous thrust (N) at time `t` seconds since ignition; `0` for `t < 0` or `t > burnTimeS`.
   460	  - `integrateImpulse(motor: Motor, dt?: number): number` — numerically integrates `thrustAt` over the burn; used by tests and sanity checks.
   461	
   462	The curve shape: rise over the first 15% of burn to a peak, sustain, taper over
   463	the last 25% to zero. A single scale factor `k` multiplies the shape so that the
   464	integral equals `motor.totalImpulseNs`.
